arter of the day's range. Day 6 is healthy when the stock is at least 5% ahead of the market since day 1, on 1.20 times average volume, with every close in the top quarter. The market is the equal-weighted index of European companies of EUR 500m or more.","Information only: only the stop-losses sell.","How to read the table: every heading sorts the table. Green = the test is met; amber = partly met or close; red = the wrong side of the test. Depth of a fall from the six-month high: Shallow Pullback 10% to 15%, Medium Pullback 15% to 20%, Deep Pullback over 20%. A date reads \"Fri 13-Nov (4D)\": the day, then how many days ago it was."]},"tiles":{"proven":{"3":"A Late Stage Indicator is met, then a trigger day: up 1.5% or more on the day, volume 1.20 times its 50-day average or more, close in the top quarter of the day's range, closing above the retested moving average (Healthy Retest) or above the six-month high (VCP).","2":"Healthy Retest: in a 2nd or later pullback or base, the price within 6% of a rising 50, 100, 150 or 200-day moving average on 5 or more of the last 10 sessions and today, with Retest volume below the 50-day average. Or VCP: an S2 Base, in a 2nd or later base, passing all four VCP tests. No trigger day yet.","1":"Pulling Back? (the S2 Pullback tests pass) or Basing / Based? (the S2 Base tests pass), in a 2nd or later pullback or base. No Late Stage Indicator yet.","0":"Classified here, but not in a 2nd or later pullback or base that passes the S2 Pullback or S2 Base tests today.","cf":"A trigger day in the last six sessions that counted on a route. Days 2, 3 and 6 after it are measured against the market."},"early":{"3":"The Late Stage Indicator is met, then a trigger day: up 1.5% or more on the day, volume 1.20 times its 50-day average or more, close in the top quarter of the day's range, closing above the retested moving average.","2":"In its 1st pullback or base: the price within 6% of a rising 50, 100, 150 or 200-day moving average on 5 or mo